# 4. Project Planning Phase
**Project Name:** EduGenie - Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

## Project Schedule & Milestones

### Milestone 1: Model Selection & Architecture Setup
* Setup Python 3.10+ virtual environment.
* Select cloud AI models (Gemini 1.5 Pro) and local models (LaMini-Flan-T5-783M).
* Establish project folder structure.

### Milestone 2: Core Functionality & Module Development
* Develop individual logic modules (`qna.py`, `explanation_module.py`, `quiz_module.py`, `summary_module.py`, `learning_path.py`).
* Implement JSON cleaning utility for structured quiz outputs.
* Build FastAPI endpoint routes in `main.py`.

### Milestone 3: Frontend Integration
* Design user input forms using HTML5/CSS3.
* Set up dynamic rendering using Jinja2 templates.
* Connect frontend form submissions to backend REST APIs.

### Milestone 4: Testing, Deployment & Documentation
* Perform functional end-to-end testing across all modules.
* Deploy application locally using Uvicorn ASGI server.
* Generate complete project documentation and demonstration materials.

